  "chapter": 1,
  "verse": 7,
  "content": [
    {
      "txt": "방향을 돌려 진행하여 <span style=\"color:crimson;\">¹</span>"
    },
    {
      "txt": "아모리",
      "link": "61b5e6bd3b8fc5001467ae2d"
    },
    {
      "txt": " "
